According to the latest data from the Sri Lanka Telecommunication Regulatory Commission, the number of Facebook and YouTube users has increased by 500,000 over the past ten months of 2024.
It is estimated that there were 15 million Facebook users in Sri Lanka by the end of December 2024.
Accordingly, Facebook is the most used social media platform in Sri Lanka.
